%% Each successful recall flattens the next forgetting drop and lets the interval grow.
flowchart LR
    learn[Learn it] --> r1[Review · same day]
    r1 --> r2[Review · +2 days]
    r2 --> r3[Review · +1 week]
    r3 --> r4[Review · +1 month]
    r4 --> durable[Durable memory]
    learn -.->|no review| gone[Mostly gone within a week]
